d &#39;</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>$</span><span>wrapper</span><span>)</span><span>.on</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;click&#39;</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>&#39;.remove-field&#39;</span><span> </span><span>,</span><span>function</span><span>(</span><span>e</span><span>)</span><span> </span><span>{</span><span>\r\n       e.preventDefault</span><span>();</span><span>\r\n        </span><span>if</span><span> </span><span>($(</span><span>&#39;.multi-field&#39;</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>$</span><span>wrapper</span><span>)</span><span>.length </span><span>&gt;</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span>)</span><span>\r\n            </span><span>$(</span><span>this</span><span>)</span><span>.parent</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;.multi-field&#39;</span><span>)</span><span>.remove</span><span>();</span><span>\r\n    </span><span>});</span><span>\r\n</span><span>});</span><span>\r\n</span><span>});</span></code></pre><pre><code><span><br></span></code></pre><pre><code><span>The output I want is in the figure below:</span></code></pre><pre><code><span><br></span></code></pre><pre><code><span><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-g3UIj1cMV6E/V1Uwvgr5RxI/AAAAAAAAAHc/UnrtmqRd4uU5o_0qbnKxs2C-oL9vYjnxwCLcB/s1600/question_html.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-g3UIj1cMV6E/V1Uwvgr5RxI/AAAAAAAAAHc/UnrtmqRd4uU5o_0qbnKxs2C-oL9vYjnxwCLcB/s1600/question_html.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393186624000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ts70y1K49U8CLGVSRiAYd\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-g3UIj1cMV6E/V1Uwvgr5RxI/AAAAAAAAAHc/UnrtmqRd4uU5o_0qbnKxs2C-oL9vYjnxwCLcB/s320/question_html.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"84\"></a></p><pre><code><span><br></span></code></pre><pre><code><span>My shiny server function is below: </span></code></pre><pre><code><sp